. <a href=\"zone-hunt.html#forging\">Forging guide</a>.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\"><code>#sellall</code></th><td>Immediately sell eligible carried items. <strong>Bank valuables first.</strong> <a href=\"equipment.html#selling\">Selling rules</a>.</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id=\"recall\">Recall is an ability</h2><p>Make a hotkey for Ancient Attunement in the General abilities tab. It returns you to the tunnel with a five-second cast and ten-minute reuse while preserving your bind point.</p>\n<h2 id=\"highkeep-dialogue\">High Keep rescue dialogue</h2><p>Hail the Gate Sergeant to begin the entrance confrontation. After defeating the four bosses, hail Osargen and choose Lead the way. An enrolled player may take over the escort by hailing him and choosing Lead the way. <a href=\"dungeon-modes.html#highkeep-rescue\">Full instructions</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"player-bazaar\">Player bazaar \u2014 live testing</h2><p>In public East Commonlands, use <code>#bazaar post &lt;price-pp&gt;</code>, <code>#bazaar confirm &lt;nonce&gt;</code>, <code>#bazaar listings</code>, <code>#bazaar cancel &lt;id&gt;</code> and <code>#bazaar collect</code>. Native <code>/bazaar</code> searches the Commonlands market. Native search and buying still need player verification; see <a href=\"tunnel.html#player-bazaar\">posting, buying and item restrictions</a>.</p>\n<p>The Bazaar window\u2019s <a href=\"tunnel.html#bazaar-seller-panel\">Sell / My Listings panel</a> provides buttons for posting, cancellation and collection after updating through the launcher. The commands above remain available. Both are in live testing.</p>",
