rrent entry and testing guide</a>.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"keyless-doors\">Keyless doors — live testing</h2><p>The removal of ordinary door key and lock-picking requirements is installed. Guild, scripted and zone/instance access rules remain. <a href=\"travel.html#keyless-doors\">Scope and instructions</a>; native player checks remain open.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"public-cazic-thule\">Public Cazic-Thule — live testing</h2><p>The Classic population is restored for ordinary travel through Khaleid. Player checks for rendering, patrols, loot and unchanged private runs remain open. <a href=\"travel.html#cazic-thule\">Entry and encounter rules</a>.</p>\n<p>Hate boss placement is corrected: Maestro and the Hand use their expected platforms, and Innoruuk occupies the southern throne area. Existing run progress and the 47 added ordinary spawns remain. <a href=\"dungeon-modes.html#hate-layout-preview\">Current landmarks</a>.</p>\n",
