n-compact\">The Ashen Compact — live testing</h2><p><a href=\"ashen-compact.html\">The Ashen Compact</a> is an installed level-50 Shadow Knight helmet campaign in a curated Kael expedition. Its paired server and client release is available for testing; full encounter, rendering and balance acceptance remain open.</p><p>Cinder of the Ashen Compact is a separate type-22 STA/INT family with mana-preservation focus at higher qualities. Its managed expedition uses a1.5% family roll from any unowned killable enemy, including scripted adds, with60/30/8/2quality weights.</p>\n<h2 id=\"hate-layout\">Hate rewards across both layouts</h2><p>The new private Hate layout uses the original Plane of Hate Hunt family, approved enemy list and drop chances. The catalog’s <a href=\"zone-hateplane.html\">hateplane rewards</a> apply to both layouts; this update does not add a second Hunt family or change forging. <a href=\"dungeon-modes.html#hate-layout-preview\">Dungeon entry and testing</a>.</p><p><a href=\"augment-audit.html\">All top-quality augments, drop zones and secondary specialties</a> — live testing; gameplay acceptance remains open.</p>",
